<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — LanDeng" description="How LanDeng (Zhangjiakou Landeng Technology Co., Ltd.) handles personal information on incenseherbs.com — a static knowledge site with email-only contact.">
  <article class="article">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-09-27 · Applies to incenseherbs.com and data.incenseherbs.com</em></p>

    <blockquote>
      This site is a static knowledge platform. We do not run analytics, advertising, or third-party
      tracking on these pages, and we collect personal information only when you contact us by email.
    </blockquote>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      LanDeng is a brand operated by <strong>Zhangjiakou Landeng Technology Co., Ltd.</strong>
      (USCC 91130702MAKM4QXH5Q). Contact: <a href="mailto:landengltd@gmail.com">landengltd@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect — and what we do not</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No accounts, no logins.</strong> This site has no user accounts.</li>
      <li><strong>No cookies, no trackers, no analytics.</strong> These are static pages; we do not set
        cookies or load third-party tracking or advertising scripts.</li>
      <li><strong>No online forms or payment collection.</strong> The inquiry form is not yet live;
        inquiries arrive by email only.</li>
      <li><strong>Email inquiries.</strong> When you email us, we receive whatever you choose to send —
        typically name, contact details, and your message. We use this information solely to respond to
        your inquiry and to keep a record of business correspondence.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use and share information</h2>
    <p>
      Inquiry information is used only to answer you and, if you proceed, to prepare quotes, samples,
      or order documentation. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third
      parties, and we do not use it for marketing without your request. We do not transfer data
      outside the correspondence you initiate.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention and your rights</h2>
    <p>
      We keep business correspondence for record-keeping and to honor warranty or commercial
      obligations. You may ask us to delete your email correspondence at any time by writing to
      <a href="mailto:landengltd@gmail.com">landengltd@gmail.com</a>; we will do so unless a legal or
      contractual obligation requires retention.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we ever add forms, analytics, or other data-processing features to this site, we will update
      this page first and date the change. The version you are reading describes the site as it
      operates today.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:landengltd@gmail.com">landengltd@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
